{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# The Return of Zero — live argument map\n\nA readable map of the governing `§0/1 → §0 → §1 → §2 → §3 → §4 → §5 → §5→0` traversal. The left column carries the essay's argument; the right column states the Agentworld pressure that keeps each station honest. The 48 granular writing movements live in [[Return of Zero — Braided Traversal]]; this Canvas deliberately stays at section scale.","x":0,"y":-520,"width":1240,"height":250,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"legend","type":"text","text":"## Reading rule\n\nEach outer station is a sixfold QL unit: `#0` ground, `#1` definition, `#2` operation, `#3` pattern, `#4` context, `#5→0` return. Blue nodes are the academic spine; yellow nodes are venue-facing obligations, not extra sections. Transverse braids recur without adding a path-explosion: **immutable gap/paradox**, **implicate–explicate process**, **computational process ontology**, **individuation**, **toroidal topology/music**, **mono–poly trust**, and **dialogical praxis**. Claims remain explicitly **Derived / Argued / Offered / Open**.","x":0,"y":-230,"width":1240,"height":250,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"s01","type":"text","text":"## [[The Return of Zero — Central Argument Plan#§0/1. The Integral Threshold — The Subject at the Formal Limit|§0/1 — The subject at the formal limit]]\n\nThe essay begins from the subject every definition presupposes but cannot finish turning into an object. It asks whether intelligence can make the horizon from which it sees available to reflection: ‘my view of the world’ becoming transparent to the world's disclosure of a situated self. Knower, means, and known quietly establish the triad before notation. Russell, Gödel, Wittgenstein, Whitehead, Spencer-Brown, Varela, Cusa, Eckhart, and *The Blind Spot* then differentiate one recurrent formal remainder. QL positions the unobjectifiable so reason can become transparent to its ground; the mechanism remains withheld.","x":0,"y":100,"width":620,"height":440,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"r01","type":"text","text":"### Agentworld obligation\n\nThe brief asks whether agency remains tied to subjectivity and notes that AI delinks performed subjectivity from functional consequence ([[Antikythera Agentworld Brief#Source PDF page 13|pp. 13–15]]). This station must define the subject without using machine incapacity as its evidence. It also begins the answer to AI fear: human subjecthood is not a shrinking competence-gap to defend against an artificial rival.","x":720,"y":125,"width":520,"height":330,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"## [[The Return of Zero — Central Argument Plan#§0. Differentiating Mind — Tattvic Descent and Objective Internality|§0 — Differentiating mind]]\n\nMind is the movement by which an implicated whole becomes a determinate world. Bohm gives the holomovement of enfolding and unfolding; the tattvas give implication its anatomy: Paramaśiva/Anuttara, Śiva–Śakti, Sadāśiva–Īśvara, Sadvidyā–Māyā, finite contraction and apparatus, Pratyabhijñā. Vikalpa differentiates; saṃkalpa composes; apoha retains the excluded field. [[Computational Process Ontology]] formalises field, cut, composition, context, and return; MEF later runs that epistemology. Objective internality is the inspectable local explicate order—the agent's situated world—distinct from its uncaught subject-pole.","x":0,"y":590,"width":620,"height":460,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"r0","type":"text","text":"### Agentworld obligation\n\nThe brief says technology has outrun its concepts and language ([[Antikythera Agentworld Brief#Source PDF page 3|p. 3]]) and describes agents as provisional laminations of model, context, persona, memory, tools, objectives, permissions, and milieu. The tattvic/process account must clarify this decomposable world-formation without pretending silicon implements Śaiva metaphysics. It should yield a shared operational language for boundaries, state, context, selection, and return while keeping human and agent subjectivity non-identical.","x":720,"y":620,"width":520,"height":350,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"## [[The Return of Zero — Central Argument Plan#§1. The Return of Zero — History, Empty Set, and Symbolic Linkage|§1 — The return of zero]]\n\nThe argument follows zero from placeholder and numeral through Indian arithmetic, intercultural transmission, empty-set construction, ordinal generation, crossed zero, and plural treatments of division by zero. `0=∅`, `1={0}`, `n+1=n∪{n}` gives the psychoid argument its exact mathematical floor while preserving the difference between represented emptiness and the condition of representation. `Ø` first shows the mark crossing zero without filling it; its psychological depth waits for §4. Exceptional division discloses each formalism's containing law. The loan returns as `0/1`, the generative root *symbolon*.","x":0,"y":1060,"width":620,"height":420,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"r1","type":"text","text":"### Agentworld obligation\n\nAgentworld is built from changing ratios—human to artificial speakers, agents to users, model to harness, individual to ensemble. This station prevents `0/1` from arriving as private symbolism and identifies zero as the meta-sign that discloses the gauge or container of a decision. A technical determination should therefore retain the field, baseline, exclusions, and provenance from which its apparent `1` arose.","x":720,"y":1100,"width":520,"height":340,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"## [[The Return of Zero — Central Argument Plan#§2. Two Logics of Two — Dia-ballein and Sym-ballein|§2 — Two logics of two]]\n\n`(+1)/(-1)` makes two as signed opposition around an external zero; `(0/1)/(1/0)` makes two as conjugate orientations of a retained ground–mark relation. Superposition belongs first to the dual-non-dual ontology: the poles are real distinctions within one appearing-act, not independent substances later joined. Dia-ballein distinguishes, excludes, ranks, routes, and actualises; sym-ballein retains provenance, recomposes, contextualises, and returns. Divide-and-conquer exposes the pulse and atomisation its arrested form. Van Eenwyk, Maturana–Varela, Ares–Aphrodite–Harmonia, and Hephaestus carry the dynamics into complexity, myth, and technē.","x":0,"y":1560,"width":620,"height":460,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"r2","type":"text","text":"### Agentworld obligation\n\nThe brief values adversariality but rejects both cooperative monoculture and unbounded fractal conflict ([[Antikythera Agentworld Brief#Source PDF page 35|p. 35]]; [[Antikythera Agentworld Brief#Source PDF page 44|p. 44]]). Conflict generates intelligence only while a common problem, institution, or evidential field survives. Warfare is dia-ballein absolutised until destruction of the rival replaces inquiry into the shared world; forced harmony is sym-ballein degraded into capture.","x":720,"y":1590,"width":520,"height":340,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"## [[The Return of Zero — Central Argument Plan#§3. Mathematical Substrate — From 0/1 to the Arche-Topos|§3 — Mathematical substrate]]\n\nThe eight determinations give the opening's perspectival question its geometry: first-, second-, and third-person views form the `180°` triangle; at `#4` their simultaneous availability opens the `360°` contextual square. Spanda and `2+2²=4+2`; re-entry, iterants, complex rotation; projective completion; quotient, cover, winding, and harmonic return compose the theorem spine. The torus becomes its kinetic display: two circulations, finite surface/infinite cover, local return with global displacement. Topology carries winding; music carries interval and cadence. Their QL braid derives the arche-topos as a coordinating differential field.","x":0,"y":2030,"width":620,"height":480,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"r3","type":"text","text":"### Agentworld obligation\n\nThe brief asks for abstraction layers that orchestrate hyperparallel reasoning and multidirectional, fractal alignment ([[Antikythera Agentworld Brief#Source PDF page 56|p. 56]]). QL must therefore be repeatable rather than merely resonant: the same unit should nest across claims, agents, and institutions while retaining provenance and disagreement. The visual and audible displays also answer the interface question—parallel relations need perceptible navigation, not a path explosion.","x":720,"y":2070,"width":520,"height":320,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"## [[The Return of Zero — Central Argument Plan#§4. Psychoid Flowering — Jung, Pauli, Lacan, and Gebser|§4 — Psychoid flowering]]\n\nJung and Pauli raise the psychoid ground prior to the psyche–matter split; Bohm gives it holomovement and the tattvas an anatomy. Jung's `X=x`, quaternity, senarius, and complexio oppositorum make individuation transparent to a larger relation. Lacan's bar releases the full crossed-zero sequence from occluded subject through visible mediation to field-availability and return. Gebser makes self-view/world-view reciprocally diaphanous without producing a view from nowhere. MEF turns that reversal into spectroscopy and runtime: claim and contextual provenance travel together. Prompt Thrownness keeps agent phenomenality Open.","x":0,"y":2510,"width":620,"height":450,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"r4","type":"text","text":"### Agentworld obligation\n\nThe narrow corridor is “same decision-procedural grammar, sufficiently divergent world models” ([[Antikythera Agentworld Brief#Source PDF page 40|p. 40]]). QL is proposed as that grammar; MEF keeps lens, source, and limit visible. Agentworld's provisional individuation and Prompt Thrownness can therefore be studied as trajectories and disclosures without forcing one ontology, equating persona with Self, or deciding machine consciousness by rhetoric.","x":720,"y":2560,"width":520,"height":310,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"s5","type":"text","text":"## [[The Return of Zero — Central Argument Plan#§5. Objective Internality and Agentic Research|§5 — Objective internality and research]]\n\nLLMs already turn mathematical transformations into context-sensitive meaning. The epistemic triad becomes technical: provisional agent-position (*pramātṛ*), model–prompt–memory–tool–harness mediation (*pramāṇa*), and world/action-field (*prameya*). Apoha, softmax, preference gauges, energy landscapes, and J-space make their differentiating process inspectable. QL retains mark, excluded field, source, and return; MEF carries lens and evidence; Bimba records the changing world-field. Six vectors test seam retention, gauge disclosure, lens refraction, topological continuity, recursion, and deferential return. Phenomenality remains Open.","x":0,"y":3010,"width":620,"height":440,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"r5","type":"text","text":"### Agentworld obligation\n\nThe brief treats trust as prediction-stability and calls for mutual legibility, harness-centric intelligence, and a commons between agents ([[Antikythera Agentworld Brief#Source PDF page 40|p. 40]]; [[Antikythera Agentworld Brief#Source PDF page 49|p. 49]]). The research task is to expose prompts, gauges, sources, exclusions, and permissions without making legibility one-sided surveillance. Objective internality must remain role-bounded; Deferential Intelligence must improve correction without manufacturing subjectivity.","x":720,"y":3050,"width":520,"height":320,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"s50","type":"text","text":"## [[The Return of Zero — Central Argument Plan#§5→0. Epi-Logos and 4:2 Technē — The Instrument Returns|§5→0 — Epi-Logos and the instrument's return]]\n\nEpi-Logos joins QL grammar, MEF runtime, Bimba world-state, and accountable harness. Bohm–Krishnamurti model meaning unfolding through dialogue; the SEED Language of Spirit gatherings carry the proposed physicist–Native elder encounter forward across sovereign knowledge-worlds. Epi-Logos makes that shared holomovement inspectable without imposing one ontology. Compassion is sensitivity to origins: the `1` returns to source, exclusion, wound, and purpose without possessing `0`. The Antikythera mechanism enters late as an attunement instrument. 4:2 Technē gives the runtime sovereign local contexts and shared protocols. AHI is reflective activity of the coupled field, not a super-subject.","x":0,"y":3500,"width":620,"height":490,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"r50","type":"text","text":"### Agentworld obligation\n\nThe brief argues that ensemble, harness, institution, and commons—not a monolithic superagent—are the units of future intelligence ([[Antikythera Agentworld Brief#Source PDF page 49|pp. 49–51]]). The close must also answer its opening diagnosis that technical capacity has outrun concepts and language. The mono–poly form is therefore linguistic and institutional: shared process grammar without shared ontology, cross-civilisational inheritance without flattening, local sovereignty without incompatibility, reciprocal legibility without capture, and planetary coordination with no final view from nowhere.","x":720,"y":3540,"width":520,"height":360,"color":"3"}
	],
